@startuml F2.1-D01-dashboard-egresso
title F2.1-D01 — Dashboard do egresso
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Egresso" as Egresso
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AlumniController" as Ctrl
participant "GetAlumniProfileUC" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Egresso -> WebApp: abre /egresso/inicio
WebApp -> Ctrl: GET /egressos/me
Ctrl -> UC: execute(alumniId do JWT)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT perfil\n(só o próprio)
Postgres --> UC: diploma + certificados + colação
UC --> Ctrl: perfil + _links
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  useActions — só download/reemitir
  Sem CTAs de criação
end note
WebApp --> Egresso: dashboard read-only

@enduml
